summary:
  The page hands the cover the lookup's kind even when the picture it
  shows is not the lookup's.

history:
  The Playing page shows the first of four pictures that loads: an
  episode's cover, the lookup's picture, the stream's own image, the
  station's logo. The line belongs to the lookup's picture only. When that
  one fails to load and the logo stands in, "Artist picture" would sit on
  the station's logo. This mutant passes the kind on regardless.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                          kind: fullRepresentation._bestArtUrl === root.albumArtUrl ? root.albumArtKind : ""

replace:
                          kind: root.albumArtKind

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_cover_answers_a_click_without_asking_the_network.
  Line-neutral.
